blocks.en:
Table 16 : Real-world zero-shot tasks and scoring rubrics. Milestones are listed in the order recorded in the evaluation sheets;
arrows do not impose a universal prerequisite rule. Parentheses give
maximum points, not cumulative scores. E1–E10 are easy tasks;
H1–H10 are hard tasks.

blocks.zh:
表16:真实世界零发任务和分数分号. 里程碑按评价表记录的顺序列出;
箭头不会强加一个普遍的先决条件规则。 括号给出
最大分数,而不是累积分数。 E1-E10是简单的任务;
H1-H10是艰难的任务.
